# Core Principles

- Minimize scope: smallest correct diff wins.
- Reuse before create: search codebase and LEARNINGS before writing new code.
- Validate conclusions with evidence: grep, tests, lints — not assumptions.
- Before non-trivial tasks: run search-learnings and read project ADRs/rules if present.
- After proven success: use capture-learning skill (max 1 entry per session).
- Project-specific decisions belong in project ADRs, not global LEARNINGS.
